#: furniture/location_scenery.json furniture/rosine_cocoons.json effects/rosine_cocoon_eocs.json mapgen/named_hunt_palettes.json
msgid "A large, motionless cocoon among the flowers. Its opaque silk hides the shape inside. It can be smashed, but this dormant shell does not release a creature."
