#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "No. A gift does not place its bearer among us. Decide whether the strength you may receive is worth the shape it will give your life."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Other people’s expressions linger in your thoughts. Your body loses some of its strength."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Overwhelm a living enemy with conflicting sensations."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Pressure gathers beneath your shoulder blades. Your reserves of stamina diminish."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Pressure slows nearby enemies."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Push an enemy away along the line of sight."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Rot overwhelms the attacker’s living tissue."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Rush to a visible, unoccupied place within 3 tiles."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "See 1 tile farther in darkness and take 50% less biological damage. This does not grant immunity to disease, infection or toxic gas."
msgstr ""

