msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Spent wings"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Step to a visible, unoccupied place within 4 tiles."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The Behelit calls: \"You need not remain powerless.\" Drench its face in blood to answer in another way. The passage it opens will change you, even if you ultimately refuse its gift; surviving afterward will be harder."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The Behelit seems to call to you. Blood might make it answer differently. A recipe to drench a Behelit in blood is available in the crafting menu. This road will leave you changed, even if you refuse its gift."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The attacker’s senses collapse beneath incompatible memories."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The five voices fall silent. The figures turn toward you."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The gift answers a new impulse. Its first fighting abilities are now yours."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The gift sharpens your senses. Its permanent weakness remains even in your human shape."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The transformation settles. It will grow no further; its strength and its price remain yours."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Unfold black wings"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Unfold borrowed faces"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Unfold cinder rot"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Unfold folded space"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Wave of pressure"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "What are you offering?"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "What would happen to my body?"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Would I become your equal?"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "You bear Slan’s limited gift; you have not become a member of the God Hand. Your transformation is complete. Hunger, heat and exhaustion remain its price."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "You have carried such fear in so small a body. Does it not tire you, holding yourself together?"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "You have heard a call. You still have an answer to give. We will not give you the comfort of calling that answer harmless."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "You have reached the end of the road that human strength opened. What will you do with the door beyond it?"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "You let the gift reshape your body."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "You remember the life you brought here? Of course you do. But do you remember it kindly, or only as it hurt?"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your body draws back into its familiar shape."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your body feels light and frail; nearby distances seem uncertain."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your body has learned another shape. You can now call on it deliberately."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your flesh grows thick and heavy. Gain +3 strength and 3 points of natural protection. You remain slower, and gas can still hurt you. Changing shape takes 2 seconds; sustaining it costs 2 kcal each minute."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your movements are exposed after a sudden burst."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your outline becomes difficult to follow. Gain +2 dexterity and reduce your visibility range by 3 tiles. Changing shape takes 2 seconds; sustaining it costs 2 kcal each minute."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your outline vanishes from ordinary sight."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your pulse slows. A bitter smell follows each breath; ordinary movement becomes slower."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your senses sharpen, while the gift’s weakness settles into your body."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your transformation is complete. You bear a limited gift of Conrad; you have not become a member of the God Hand. Your abilities and weaknesses will grow no further."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your transformation is complete. You bear a limited gift of Femto; you have not become a member of the God Hand. Your abilities and weaknesses will grow no further."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your transformation is complete. You bear a limited gift of Ubik; you have not become a member of the God Hand. Your abilities and weaknesses will grow no further."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your transformation is complete. You bear a limited gift of Void; you have not become a member of the God Hand. Your abilities and weaknesses will grow no further."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "empty likeness"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Live through the borrowed flesh"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The gift is changing you without another dose. Find food, water and a place to rest. Learn the weaknesses of your new body and wait for its final shape. Your road journal keeps a remembered trail to an ashen wound; follow it when you are prepared."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "You return to the living world. A broken road and an ashen wound linger behind your eyes. You record that trail in your road journal. Find food and somewhere to recover before following it."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The wound cools and its heartbeat stops. This place has grown quieter; the flesh you brought back has not changed. Among the defenders’ marks you find three roads: a fortified residence, the Black Dogs’ camp and a misty valley. You preserve them in your road journal."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The wound does not answer. Its keeper must fall before you can reach the exposed heart of the breach."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*Your new flesh has settled. Follow the ashen trail when prepared, or choose another road you already know. The gift does not choose your enemies for you."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*Now: find food, water and a place to recover while your body changes. The ashen trail is preserved in your journal; it can wait until you are ready."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*You kept your human body. Recover and learn to live with the wounds of the ceremony. A remembered ashen trail gives you a road onward."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The trail I brought back from the ceremony."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*A broken road, a ruined foundation, ash around a wound in the earth. The vision stayed with you when the voices fell silent. It may lead to another opening between the worlds. The journey is yours to choose; prepare a way to retreat."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Open the entry for the ashen trail."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Review only the roads I already know."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*The gift has only taken root. Its weakness is already yours. Find food and rest; your body will keep changing without another dose."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*Your senses have changed. Give your body time to learn its next shape; the weakness you accepted has not gone away."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*Your other shape is ready. You can call on it through the mutations menu. Changing shape does not heal wounds. Its fighting powers are still taking root."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*Your first fighting powers are awake. Learn their cost and leave room to recover between uses. The last change has not yet settled."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*You are an apostle bearing a limited gift. The necessary changes are complete; no further dose or growth is needed. Your powers, their costs and your weakness remain."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*You refused the gift. The lasting wounds of the ceremony grant no demonic strength. Rest and prepare before following the ashen trail."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "That body is no excuse to forget what your hands do. If you came for honest work, we can talk. Keep your quarrels away from the boy and my hearth."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Something has changed in me. Can we talk?"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "I accepted a gift beyond this world."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "I recognize you, but your body frightens me. Tell me what happened. I can still work on your equipment; that does not mean I have agreed to everything you do."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "I am Rickert. Please keep some distance while we talk. I have never seen a body like yours, but you came here speaking instead of attacking."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your gift makes this road more dangerous, not less. I will choose for myself whether to walk it. We need to speak about what you intend to do with that strength."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Then let us talk about the gift first."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Iron does not care what lives beneath your skin. I care what you bring to my door. You may ask for work. Do not mistake that for permission to hurt the people under this roof."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Can the forge still help me?"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "How do I keep this strength from becoming my whole life?"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A spark is bright and soon gone. The hearth keeps somebody warm after the hammer falls silent. Your new flesh can win a fight; it cannot tell you what deserves to survive it. Decide that before you reach for the fire."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "You chose that gift? I cannot pretend it is an ordinary wound. But I will listen. Tell me whether you still mean to treat other people as people."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "I accepted strength. I will not use people as tools."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "You can still help me without walking my road."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "With this power, people should obey me. So should you."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "I am not ready to talk about it."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "I hope you mean that. I will still stay here; my answer about traveling has not changed. Bring the work to the forge if you need help."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Then we can keep talking. A promise does not make the road safe, and I still have a say in whether I go. My crossbow and my tools are not yours to command."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Let us discuss the road as equals."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A gift from beyond the veil has taken root in you. I will not mistake it for the Brand. Sit by the hearth if you came to speak; the choice of what you do with this flesh is still yours."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "What do you see in the gift I accepted?"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The change will continue on its own and then settle. More blood will not make you master it. Learn its hunger, its weakness and the time it needs to answer you. Closing a wound in the world will not undo your bargain."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Does the gift oblige me to serve them?"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Can the armor hide or cure this change?"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A gift and a command are different things. They have changed what you are capable of, but your next deed is still your own. Do not expect other apostles to welcome you as kin. Their appetites need not agree with yours."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "No. The armor cannot return the body you surrendered. It is another danger, with its own price. If you ask for it, understand both burdens before you trust either one in battle."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "I did not carry you from that circle. You returned by its will, bearing its gift. I will hear you, but do not mistake this meeting for an alliance."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "You came back from the circle without its gift. The wounds it left are not the Brand. Ask what you need to know before I ride on."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "What remains for someone who came back as I did?"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Prepare for the road before testing what the ceremony left you. The ashen wound you remember can be closed, but it will not change your body back. Other wounds and their keepers remain. Decide which known trail is yours to follow; strength alone will not decide it."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Are other apostles now my allies?"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Let me keep these directions in my journal."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "No. You have received power, not their loyalty. An apostle can turn on another apostle. The people you meet will judge the shape before them and the deeds they witness. Choose what you show them."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The wound cools and its heartbeat stops. This place has grown quieter; the price of the ceremony remains with you. Among the defenders’ marks you find three roads: a fortified residence, the Black Dogs’ camp and a misty valley. You preserve them in your road journal."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "I lost my road journal. Could I have another?"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Pliant flesh"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your steps become heavier. Movement is 10 points slower, even in human shape."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Hunting beast"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your muscles strain against a slower recovery. Stamina regeneration is reduced by 10%, even in human shape."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Winged hunter"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your skin grows thin and sensitive. Take 15% more bash, cut and stab damage, even in human shape."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Cinder carapace"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A hot hunger settles into your body. Burn 35% more calories and recover stamina 15% more slowly, even in human shape."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Unfold heavy, pliant flesh: +3 strength and 3 points of natural protection. Your slower movement remains. Changing shape takes 2 seconds; sustaining it costs 3 kcal each minute. It does not heal wounds."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Unfold a hunting beast: +3 strength, +15% melee damage and -2 dexterity. Your stamina still recovers slowly. Changing shape takes 2 seconds; sustaining it costs 3 kcal each minute. It does not heal wounds."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Unfold insectlike wings: +2 dexterity, +15 speed and half falling damage. Wings permit gliding with a light load and usable arms, not free ascent into the sky. Torso encumbrance above 20 prevents your wing abilities. Your fragile flesh remains. Changing shape takes 2 seconds; sustaining it costs 3 kcal each minute."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Unfold a fiery carapace: +3 strength, 6 points of natural protection, -15 speed and 50% less heat damage. Hunger and slow recovery remain. Changing shape takes 2 seconds; sustaining it costs 5 kcal each minute. It does not heal wounds or make fire harmless."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The borrowed flesh sharpens your senses. Its weakness has taken root too."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your body has learned its other shape. You can now unfold it deliberately."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A fighting instinct wakes in the flesh. Your first new ability is ready."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The borrowed flesh has settled. This transformation is complete; its strength and its weakness remain."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your body unfolds into the borrowed shape."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The borrowed shape draws back beneath your skin."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Seed: pliant flesh"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Senses: pliant flesh"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The flesh sharpens your perception in darkness. Its lasting weakness remains in either shape."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Unfold: pliant flesh"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Apostle: pliant flesh"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your independent transformation is complete. You are a weaker likeness of the fallen apostle, not its rebirth or servant. No further portion is needed; the weakness remains."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Seed: hunting beast"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Senses: hunting beast"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Unfold: hunting beast"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Apostle: hunting beast"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Seed: winged hunter"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Senses: winged hunter"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Unfold: winged hunter"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Apostle: winged hunter"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Seed: cinder carapace"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Senses: cinder carapace"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Unfold: cinder carapace"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Apostle: cinder carapace"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "the Count's undying flesh"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Wyald's undying flesh"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Rosine's undying flesh"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Grunbeld's undying flesh"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Absorb the Count’s flesh? You will slowly become a heavy, pliant apostle. Your movement will remain slower, even in human shape. This is permanent: no other main line can take root afterward. You cannot undo the choice by closing a breach."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Absorb Wyald’s flesh? You will slowly become a beastlike apostle. Your stamina will recover more slowly; precise work will suffer in your fighting shape. This is permanent: no other main line can take root afterward."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Absorb Rosine’s flesh? You will slowly become a winged insectlike apostle. Your flesh will take more physical damage, even in human shape. Heavy equipment restricts your winged movements. This is permanent: no other main line can take root afterward."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Absorb Grunbeld’s flesh? You will slowly grow an armored, fiery shape. Hunger and slow stamina recovery remain even in human shape; breathing fire overheats your body. This is permanent: no other main line can take root afterward."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "This severed flesh still pulses and does not decay. It is no ordinary food. Deliberately absorbing it begins a lasting transformation into a weaker, independent likeness of its former owner. One portion is enough for the whole change. Another lineage cannot be combined with it."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Absorb the flesh"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The flesh remains in your hands. Your body cannot accept this path, or another change has already taken root."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The flesh dissolves beneath your skin. The change has begun and will finish without another portion. Find food, water and somewhere to rest; your road journal records its progress."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A remnant of the fallen apostle still pulses among the cooled folds. It has not decayed."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Exposed flesh"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your heavy strike leaves you exposed for a moment."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Crushing grip"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A crushing grip slows movement."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Restless wings"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Swift wingbeats help you avoid an attack."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Overheated carapace"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Heat trapped in your flesh slows you and prevents another fiery breath."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Braced carapace"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your braced shell offers extra protection at the cost of movement."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Pliant tendril"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Strike with a heavy tendril."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "In your fighting shape, strike an enemy within 2 tiles for 20 bash damage. Costs 900 stamina and 2 seconds; recovers in 16 seconds. Dodge is reduced by 2 for 3 seconds afterward."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "This ability needs your fighting shape, enough strength and time to recover. Winged movements also need room for your equipment."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Draw flesh together"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "In your fighting shape, heal 3 HP on each injured major body part. Costs 1000 stamina, 80 kcal and 3 seconds; recovers in 2 minutes. It cannot regrow a lost hand or eye. No cost when you are uninjured."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Beast rush"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Rush along an open path."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "In your fighting shape, rush up to 3 tiles along an open path. Walls and creatures stop the rush. Costs 1200 stamina and 1 second; recovers in 18 seconds. A fully blocked or canceled rush costs nothing."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Beast grip"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Slow a nearby enemy with a crushing grip."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "In your fighting shape, deal 10 bash damage to an adjacent enemy and slow it by 25 for 4 seconds. Costs 900 stamina and 1 second; recovers in 18 seconds. This does not make the enemy helpless."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Winged dive"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Dive along an open path."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Winged sweep"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Cut nearby enemies after landing."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "In your fighting shape, dive up to 4 tiles along an open path, then deal 18 cut damage to enemies next to the landing. Costs 1500 stamina and 1 second; recovers in 20 seconds. Torso encumbrance must be at most 20. Your dodge is reduced by 2 for 2 seconds afterward. A fully blocked or canceled dive costs nothing."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Evasive wingbeats"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "In your fighting shape, gain +2 dodge for 3 seconds. Costs 700 stamina and 1 second; recovers in 20 seconds. Torso encumbrance must be at most 20."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Cinder breath"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Breathe a narrow cone of fire."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "In your fighting shape, breathe fire in a narrow cone up to 5 tiles for 26 heat damage. The flames can burn you, companions and belongings. Costs 1800 stamina, 60 kcal and 2 seconds; recovers in 45 seconds. You overheat for 12 seconds, losing 15 speed and the ability to breathe fire again."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Brace the shell"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "In your fighting shape, gain 3 extra points of natural protection for 4 seconds, but lose 20 speed. Costs 1100 stamina and 1 second; recovers in 30 seconds. It grants no invulnerability."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Live through the apostle’s flesh"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "You deliberately absorbed the remains of a fallen apostle. Find food, water and rest while your body changes. One portion is enough; learn your new abilities and their weaknesses, then continue a road you already know."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*The absorbed flesh is changing you on its own. Secure food, water and a resting place. Its weakness remains in both shapes. Continue the roads you already know when prepared; no new dose is needed."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The flesh I absorbed."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*Your independent transformation is growing from a single absorbed remain. The weakness is permanent. Early senses appear first; the fighting shape and its abilities follow."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*Pliant flesh: the transformation is complete. No further portions or growth are needed. Continue an already known road; your abilities and their cost remain."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*Hunting beast: the transformation is complete. No further portions or growth are needed. Continue an already known road; your abilities and their cost remain."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*Winged hunter: the transformation is complete. No further portions or growth are needed. Continue an already known road; your abilities and their cost remain."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*Cinder carapace: the transformation is complete. No further portions or growth are needed. Continue an already known road; your abilities and their cost remain."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Review the roads I already know."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "My body is changing. Can we talk about it?"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "You took that flesh into yourself? I need to know what you intend to do now. I can still work on your equipment, but I will decide for myself whether we travel together."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The fallen apostle’s flesh has found a new bearer. It will settle without another portion. Learn its hunger and weakness. Victory over its former owner does not spare you the price, and closing a breach will not undo the change."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The apostle fell, but you chose to carry its flesh within you. That choice does not erase what came before. I will answer your questions while I remain here; do not expect its power to make the other apostles loyal to you."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "What should I do with this change?"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Learn the body you have chosen: its hunger, its recovery and where it leaves you vulnerable. You have gained strength, not an answer to every wound in the world. Your known roads remain; prepare before following them."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Answered impulse"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The flesh answers a completed impulse."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*Your senses have changed. The weakness of the absorbed flesh remains even in human shape; prepare food and rest while the body continues to change."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*You can deliberately unfold your fighting shape. Learn its strengths and limitations before risking another hunt. The fighting abilities are still developing."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*The first fighting ability is ready. Learn its cost and recovery; another ability will follow when the flesh settles."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "What do you see in the change within me?"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The flesh of a fallen apostle has taken root in you. It is a different wound from the Brand. If you came to speak, sit by the hearth. What you do with this body remains your choice."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The offer is withdrawn. The apostle advances."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your attack breaks the pact. The borrowed body remains, but its master’s protection and favor are gone."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The bond falls silent. Your master is dead; your body remains a limited servant’s shape. No greater power takes its place."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Listening"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The creature pauses to hear an answer."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Servant of the Count"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Beast of the Black Dogs"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Child of the false valley"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Carapace vassal"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your altered flesh slows you in either shape. The Count shelters his own, but only while the pact holds. Your strength will never equal his."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Stamina returns more slowly, and beast hands hinder precise work. Wyald’s favor feeds your strongest impulse; you remain his lesser fighter."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Words become awkward clicks, persuasion falters and crafting slows. Your body is fragile. You can still choose, speak and act; Rosine has not made you a mindless creature."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your heavy body moves more slowly and needs more food, even without the fighting shell. You serve Grunbeld; this lesser shell will never grow into his dragon."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The borrowed flesh settles into another change."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Bound protection: Servant of the Count"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your master and their marked servants leave you alone while you keep the pact. This protects you alone; it does not command demons or make them loyal to your companions."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Lesser senses: Servant of the Count"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Unfold: Servant of the Count"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Borrowed impulse: Servant of the Count"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your limited fighting impulse requires recent service to your living master. The body and its weaknesses remain if the bond breaks, but this impulse falls silent."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Pawn: Servant of the Count"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The limited servant’s body is complete. Neither more flesh nor the master’s death will turn it into an independent apostle. Your choices remain your own, but the pact has a lasting price."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Bound protection: Beast of the Black Dogs"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Lesser senses: Beast of the Black Dogs"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Unfold: Beast of the Black Dogs"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Borrowed impulse: Beast of the Black Dogs"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Pawn: Beast of the Black Dogs"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Bound protection: Child of the false valley"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Lesser senses: Child of the false valley"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Unfold: Child of the false valley"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Borrowed impulse: Child of the false valley"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Pawn: Child of the false valley"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Bound protection: Carapace vassal"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Lesser senses: Carapace vassal"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Unfold: Carapace vassal"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Borrowed impulse: Carapace vassal"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Pawn: Carapace vassal"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Bring two pieces of leather for the household stores. In return I will nourish the strength I gave you."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Bring twelve scraps of metal for my men’s gear. Earn your next burst of strength."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Bring four pieces of animal meat to feed the nest. Then you may use the gift again."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Bring four steel lumps for the damaged armor. Service earns strength; the shell alone does not."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Accept the pact? Your body will change permanently into a weaker servant’s form, with lasting drawbacks. Other main transformations will be closed to you. Your master and their servants will spare you, but not necessarily your companions. Your strongest impulse requires supplies for the living master; betraying them ends their protection. Their death will not free you into a stronger form."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The pact takes root beneath your skin. Its price and your first service are recorded in the road journal."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your offering is accepted. For six hours the bond will answer your fighting impulse."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "First service: Count"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "First service: Wyald"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "First service: Rosine"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "First service: Grunbeld"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Borrowed strike"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A limited impulse of the master’s flesh."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The impulse does not answer. Assume your fighting shape, recover your stamina and honor the service owed to a living master."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Borrowed defense"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your lesser form briefly braces itself."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A place at my court, walls between you and the night. I can make you worth keeping. Look at my servants: none need fear exile, so long as they remember whom they serve."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "You’ve got nerve. Forget the rules that keep weak men crawling. Run with the Black Dogs, and I’ll give you claws to match it. Just remember: even a beast knows who leads the pack."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Why go back where everyone hurts you? Stay with us. You can be light and quick, and never alone again. Don’t mind their voices; they hardly need words here."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A fragile body is no answer to the battles ahead. I offer a shell and a place among those who endure. You will serve, not reign. Decide before taking another step toward me."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The uniforms hang on bodies that no longer fit them. One servant bows before the Count has even spoken. You would gain shelter, but not an equal’s freedom."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "His men keep out of reach of his hands. The promise of freedom ends wherever Wyald’s amusement begins. The strength he offers is a leash with teeth."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The little shapes around the nest chirr instead of answering. Their human belongings lie among torn cocoons. You would keep your will, but words and skilled hands would become harder to use."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The armor bears scars of service rather than honor. He offers endurance, not his dragon’s fire. The heavy shell would remain even if its owner stopped answering."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Back to your offer."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "There is no offer now. The apostle has chosen battle."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "What will happen to me?"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "What do you expect in return?"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "I accept. Let me weigh the price once more."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "I will not serve you."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Here are the supplies you demanded."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Enough. I am leaving."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*Your pact is changing you into a lesser servant. Prepare food and rest. To use the strongest impulse, deliver the agreed supplies to your master: their favor lasts six hours. Attacking the master or their transformed servants breaks the pact. Your body will stay limited even if the master dies."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*The master is dead. Your servant’s body and weaknesses remain. Their favor cannot be renewed, and no stronger form has replaced yours. Continue the roads you already know."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*You broke the pact. Its protection and strongest impulse are gone; the lesser body and its weaknesses remain. No second main transformation can replace it."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "My pact and service."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "So you took a master along with that body. I can still work steel for you, but I won’t pretend a leash is freedom. What you do next is still yours to answer for."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "You agreed to serve one of them? I can repair equipment, but I need to know where you stand. I won’t follow orders from your master, and coming with you remains my decision."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The power has a tether. You remain able to choose, but breaking the pact cannot restore the body you had. Nor will your master’s death make you their equal. Learn the price before you spend this strength."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your master’s servants may spare you. That is not command over demons. Other apostles owe you nothing, and companions who trust you have not accepted your pact."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Accept the pact? Your body will change permanently into a weaker servant’s form, with lasting drawbacks. Other main transformations will be closed to you. Your master will spare you; this does not protect companions or command every demon at the site. Your strongest impulse requires supplies for the living master; betrayal ends their protection. Their death will not give a stronger form. You abandon the hunt against this master."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Review my pact."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your service has been accepted. The borrowed impulse is sustained for now; no further supplies are due until that favor fades."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Stop there and answer. If you turn away from this offer, we meet as enemies."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A place at my court, walls between you and the night. I can make you worth keeping. Look at my servants: none need fear exile, so long as they remember whom they serve. Stop there and answer. If you turn away from this offer, we meet as enemies."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "You’ve got nerve. Forget the rules that keep weak men crawling. Run with the Black Dogs, and I’ll give you claws to match it. Just remember: even a beast knows who leads the pack. Stop there and answer. If you turn away from this offer, we meet as enemies."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Why go back where everyone hurts you? Stay with us. You can be light and quick, and never alone again. Don’t mind their voices; they hardly need words here. Stop there and answer. If you turn away from this offer, we meet as enemies."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A fragile body is no answer to the battles ahead. I offer a shell and a place among those who endure. You will serve, not reign. Decide before taking another step toward me. Stop there and answer. If you turn away from this offer, we meet as enemies."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*Your pact is changing you into a lesser servant. Prepare food and rest. To use the strongest impulse, deliver the agreed supplies to your master: their favor lasts six hours. Attacking the master or their transformed servants breaks the pact. Your body will stay limited even if the master dies. Bring two pieces of leather for the household stores. In return I will nourish the strength I gave you."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*Your pact is changing you into a lesser servant. Prepare food and rest. To use the strongest impulse, deliver the agreed supplies to your master: their favor lasts six hours. Attacking the master or their transformed servants breaks the pact. Your body will stay limited even if the master dies. Bring twelve scraps of metal for my men’s gear. Earn your next burst of strength."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*Your pact is changing you into a lesser servant. Prepare food and rest. To use the strongest impulse, deliver the agreed supplies to your master: their favor lasts six hours. Attacking the master or their transformed servants breaks the pact. Your body will stay limited even if the master dies. Bring four pieces of animal meat to feed the nest. Then you may use the gift again."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "*Your pact is changing you into a lesser servant. Prepare food and rest. To use the strongest impulse, deliver the agreed supplies to your master: their favor lasts six hours. Attacking the master or their transformed servants breaks the pact. Your body will stay limited even if the master dies. Bring four steel lumps for the damaged armor. Service earns strength; the shell alone does not."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "I accepted an apostle’s pact. What remains mine?"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your will remains. The master holds a power you accepted, not every deed you may choose. Breaking the pact ends the shelter it offered; it will not return your old flesh. Nor does killing its giver make you their equal. Learn your limits before another battle."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The bond no longer answers. Your will remains, and so does the lesser flesh you accepted. Neither a broken oath nor a dead master restores humanity or grants their full strength. Choose the next road with the body you truly have."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Accept the pact? Your body will change permanently into a weaker servant’s form, with lasting drawbacks. Other main transformations will be closed to you. Your master will spare you; this does not protect companions or command every demon at the site. Do not attack the master or their marked servants, and keep companions from attacking them: their attack also breaks your pact. Your strongest impulse requires supplies for the living master. Betrayal ends their protection; their death gives no stronger form. You abandon the hunt against this master."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your offering is accepted. Its support will not be wasted while your body grows: the fighting impulse will be sustained for its first six hours after awakening."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "restore up to 6 HP to each major body part. Costs 1200 stamina, 60 kcal and 6 seconds; recovers in 10 minutes. It cannot restore a missing hand or eye."
