#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Your permanent fiery carapace grants +3 strength, 6 points of natural protection, -15 speed and 50% less heat damage. Hunger and slow recovery remain. This body is permanent; returning to human shape is impossible. It does not heal wounds or make fire harmless."
