#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Only a worn fastening remains."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "I hid this before they counted us. The cage doors are tied, not locked with iron keys. Untie them from either side and pass through; the quarry is longer but stays open. One name at the bottom is followed by a small word: escaped."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "We called the stone a miracle because we needed one. We moved it behind the altar and stopped opening the door to strangers. When the whispers began, we thought we had been answered. The handprints on the altar were not made in prayer."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The transport order is crossed out. Below it: Three of us described the same red face after sleeping here. When we moved the specimen, the scratching began outside its new tent. Pavel is hurt; the creature caught him when he stepped into the open. Cancel collection of the sample. Send transport for the wounded. We are leaving the equipment."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Mikhail, if you reach the camp first: we moved the wounded into the southwestern tent. The creature came out of the northern tent and caught Pavel in the open. Keep behind the canvas and use the gap in the eastern cordon. We are leaving before dusk. — Lena"
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "The last prayer has been crossed out. Beneath it: We barred the front doors to keep the strangers away. Now the footsteps are inside. Irina took the remaining blankets through the sacristy; I could not persuade her to come back for the stone. The western wall is broken. Follow the living while there is still time."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A folded warning is tied to a stake beside the southern entrance. Rain has blurred the first line, but directions for the wounded are still legible."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "A rain-marked warning left for a late-arriving member of the survey team. It describes the wounded and a way out of the camp."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "Day two: the case was moved to the northeastern tent after three people reported the same face in their dreams. Day three: Pavel was attacked between the tents. Day four: Lena brought the wounded to the medical tent. The final transport request is unsigned. Most of the equipment was left packed, as if departure was only minutes away."
msgstr ""

#. New Horizon 3.3: apostle path
msgid "String marks the successive positions of the measuring instruments. Each day the circle was moved farther from the case. Beside it, a sleep log repeats the same three names and the same sketch of a red face. The last line records the attack on Pavel."
msgstr ""

